{"id":"c472b2ba86057172","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-signed-predicate-translation.md","title":"df signed predicate translation","display":"df signed predicate translation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-signed-predicate-translation","aliases":["72-df-signed-predicate-translation"],"display":"df signed predicate translation","depends_on":["[[72-df-four-valued-structure]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IX §§2.3.1–2.3.5, print646–647/PDF658–659","verification_status":"source-definition-and-statement-checked; local induction checked","proof_status":"proved-in-note by structural induction and coordinate inverses","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-signed-predicate-translation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-signed-predicate-translation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df signed predicate translation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"40bb12b12b7a39e7\" href=\"?note=40bb12b12b7a39e7\" title=\"72-df-four-valued-structure\">72-df-four-valued-structure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IX §§2.3.1–2.3.5, print646–647/PDF658–659"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-and-statement-checked; local induction checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"proved-in-note by structural induction and coordinate inverses"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"40bb12b12b7a39e7\" href=\"?note=40bb12b12b7a39e7\" title=\"72-df-four-valued-structure\">72-df-four-valued-structure</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\">\\(\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}\">\\(\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}\\)</span>、非空域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>、项和 LP 公式。将Σ中每个R替成同元数互异 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^+,R^-\">\\(R^+,R^-\\)</span>，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^\\pm\">\\(\\Sigma^\\pm\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 是论域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 的四值结构；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 遍历与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 有相同D与项解释的二值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^\\pm\">\\(\\Sigma^\\pm\\)</span> 结构，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in D^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}\">\\(s\\in D^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}\">\\(R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec d\\in D^{a_R(R)}\">\\(\\vec d\\in D^{a_R(R)}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^{a_R(R)}\">\\(\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^{a_R(R)}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(R^+)^N,(R^-)^N:D^{a_R(R)}\\to\\mathbf2\">\\((R^+)^N,(R^-)^N:D^{a_R(R)}\\to\\mathbf2\\)</span> 是独立关系的特征函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1_\\psi\">\\(\\mathbf1_\\psi\\)</span> 为经典命题ψ的0/1真值。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^+,A^-\">\\(A^+,A^-\\)</span> 是下式递归，目标公式使用经典二值解释。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n(R^+)^{M^\\pm}(\\vec d)&amp;:=(R^M(\\vec d))_+,\\quad(R^-)^{M^\\pm}(\\vec d):=(R^M(\\vec d))_-,\\\\\nR^{N^4}(\\vec d)&amp;:=((R^+)^N(\\vec d),(R^-)^N(\\vec d)),\\\\\n(R(\\vec t))^+&amp;:=R^+(\\vec t),\\quad(R(\\vec t))^-:=R^-(\\vec t),\\quad(\\overline R(\\vec t))^+:=R^-(\\vec t),\\quad(\\overline R(\\vec t))^-:=R^+(\\vec t),\\\\\n(t\\doteq u)^+&amp;:=(t\\doteq u),\\quad(t\\doteq u)^-:=\\neg(t\\doteq u),\\quad(t\\ne u)^+:=\\neg(t\\doteq u),\\quad(t\\ne u)^-:=(t\\doteq u),\\\\\n\\top^+&amp;:=\\top,\\quad\\top^-:=\\bot,\\quad\\bot^+:=\\bot,\\quad\\bot^-:=\\top,\\\\\n(A\\land B)^+&amp;:=A^+\\land B^+,\\quad(A\\land B)^-:=A^-\\lor B^-,\\quad(A\\lor B)^+:=A^+\\lor B^+,\\quad(A\\lor B)^-:=A^-\\land B^-,\\\\\n(\\exists xA)^+&amp;:=\\exists xA^+,\\quad(\\exists xA)^-:=\\forall xA^-,\\quad(\\forall xA)^+:=\\forall xA^+,\\quad(\\forall xA)^-:=\\exists xA^-.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n(R^+)^{M^\\pm}(\\vec d)&amp;:=(R^M(\\vec d))_+,\\quad(R^-)^{M^\\pm}(\\vec d):=(R^M(\\vec d))_-,\\\\\nR^{N^4}(\\vec d)&amp;:=((R^+)^N(\\vec d),(R^-)^N(\\vec d)),\\\\\n(R(\\vec t))^+&amp;:=R^+(\\vec t),\\quad(R(\\vec t))^-:=R^-(\\vec t),\\quad(\\overline R(\\vec t))^+:=R^-(\\vec t),\\quad(\\overline R(\\vec t))^-:=R^+(\\vec t),\\\\\n(t\\doteq u)^+&amp;:=(t\\doteq u),\\quad(t\\doteq u)^-:=\\neg(t\\doteq u),\\quad(t\\ne u)^+:=\\neg(t\\doteq u),\\quad(t\\ne u)^-:=(t\\doteq u),\\\\\n\\top^+&amp;:=\\top,\\quad\\top^-:=\\bot,\\quad\\bot^+:=\\bot,\\quad\\bot^-:=\\top,\\\\\n(A\\land B)^+&amp;:=A^+\\land B^+,\\quad(A\\land B)^-:=A^-\\lor B^-,\\quad(A\\lor B)^+:=A^+\\lor B^+,\\quad(A\\lor B)^-:=A^-\\land B^-,\\\\\n(\\exists xA)^+&amp;:=\\exists xA^+,\\quad(\\exists xA)^-:=\\forall xA^-,\\quad(\\forall xA)^+:=\\forall xA^+,\\quad(\\forall xA)^-:=\\exists xA^-.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(M^\\pm)^4=M,\\qquad(N^4)^\\pm=N,\\qquad⟦ A⟧_{M,s}=(\\mathbf1_{M^\\pm,s\\models A^+},\\mathbf1_{M^\\pm,s\\models A^-}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(M^\\pm)^4=M,\\qquad(N^4)^\\pm=N,\\qquad⟦ A⟧_{M,s}=(\\mathbf1_{M^\\pm,s\\models A^+},\\mathbf1_{M^\\pm,s\\models A^-}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书IX§2.3定义与Remark2.3.5。最后式逐公式结构归纳：正/负坐标在合取析取与量词处分别对应所显示的双重逻辑操作。两个结构转换直接按R两坐标互逆。逆转换现在直接使用关系的特征函数，避免把任意域元素⃗d未经命名就当成对象语言项。R<sup>-是独立关系，除非另加补集公理，不等于¬R</sup>+。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-four-valued-structure","status":"resolved","id":"40bb12b12b7a39e7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-four-valued-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-four-valued-structure","status":"resolved","id":"40bb12b12b7a39e7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[72-df-four-valued-structure]] 的 $\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle$、$\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}$、非空域 $D$、项和 LP 公式。将Σ中每个R替成同元数互异 $R^+,R^-$，得到 $\\Sigma^\\pm$。$M$ 是论域为 $D$ 的四值结构；$N$ 遍历与 $M$ 有相同D与项解释的二值 $\\Sigma^\\pm$ 结构，$s\\in D^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"R^+,R^-","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^\\pm","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^\\pm","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in D^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec d\\in D^{a_R(R)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^{a_R(R)}","display":false},{"tex":"t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"(R^+)^N,(R^-)^N:D^{a_R(R)}\\to\\mathbf2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1_\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"A^+,A^-","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n(R^+)^{M^\\pm}(\\vec d)&:=(R^M(\\vec d))_+,\\quad(R^-)^{M^\\pm}(\\vec d):=(R^M(\\vec d))_-,\\\\\nR^{N^4}(\\vec d)&:=((R^+)^N(\\vec d),(R^-)^N(\\vec d)),\\\\\n(R(\\vec t))^+&:=R^+(\\vec t),\\quad(R(\\vec t))^-:=R^-(\\vec t),\\quad(\\overline R(\\vec t))^+:=R^-(\\vec t),\\quad(\\overline R(\\vec t))^-:=R^+(\\vec t),\\\\\n(t\\doteq u)^+&:=(t\\doteq u),\\quad(t\\doteq u)^-:=\\neg(t\\doteq u),\\quad(t\\ne u)^+:=\\neg(t\\doteq u),\\quad(t\\ne u)^-:=(t\\doteq u),\\\\\n\\top^+&:=\\top,\\quad\\top^-:=\\bot,\\quad\\bot^+:=\\bot,\\quad\\bot^-:=\\top,\\\\\n(A\\land B)^+&:=A^+\\land B^+,\\quad(A\\land B)^-:=A^-\\lor B^-,\\quad(A\\lor B)^+:=A^+\\lor B^+,\\quad(A\\lor B)^-:=A^-\\land B^-,\\\\\n(\\exists xA)^+&:=\\exists xA^+,\\quad(\\exists xA)^-:=\\forall xA^-,\\quad(\\forall xA)^+:=\\forall xA^+,\\quad(\\forall xA)^-:=\\exists xA^-.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"(M^\\pm)^4=M,\\qquad(N^4)^\\pm=N,\\qquad⟦ A⟧_{M,s}=(\\mathbf1_{M^\\pm,s\\models A^+},\\mathbf1_{M^\\pm,s\\models A^-}).","display":true}],"bytes":2722,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-275","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-signed-predicate-translation|df signed predicate translation]]"},{"id":"86860ecaa6585b53","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathsf{Program}_\\Sigma$，$D_R^P$ 采用 [[72-df-program-definition-form]]；$\\Sigma^\\pm,R^+,R^-$ 与 $A^+,A^-$ 采用 [[72-df-signed-predicate-translation]]。目标使用 core 的经典公式构造子 $\\to,\\land,\\lor,\\forall,\\exists$；$R^-$ 是独立的正关系符号。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-275","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-signed-predicate-translation|df signed predicate translation]]"}],"outgoing":["40bb12b12b7a39e7"]}